    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCharming 2/3 Bedroom Dormer Residence in the Heart of Historic Slane Village with FPP For Airbnb. FPP for additional bedroom to ground floor (Planning File Ref: SA110380)\n\nNestled within an attractive courtyard setting in the picturesque village of Slane, this beautifully designed two-bedroom dormer residence offers a unique opportunity to acquire a character-filled home with exceptional investment potential.\n\nBenefiting from full planning permission for use as an Airbnb holiday rental, the property is ideally positioned to take advantage of Slane's thriving tourism market while also serving as a stylish private residence.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and welcoming throughout, with large windows flooding the interior with natural light and creating an airy, contemporary living environment. Thoughtfully designed living spaces combine comfort and practicality, while the dormer layout provides two well-proportioned bedrooms and flexible accommodation.\n\nThe property also benefits from one allocated parking space, offering convenience in this sought-after village location.\n\nSituated adjacent to one of the four iconic Georgian houses that define the historic character of Slane Village, the residence enjoys a truly distinctive setting. Residents and visitors alike can appreciate the rich architectural heritage, charming streetscape, and vibrant village atmosphere, with cafés, restaurants, shops, and local amenities all within easy walking distance.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a distinctive property in one of County Meath's most celebrated and historic villages, we look forward to showing you around!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith laminate flooring, glass panel to door fills this space with natural light.\n\nBathroom - \nPartly tiled, bath with shower head, electric wall mounted heater, extractor fan for ventilation.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - \nA large space for entertaining and family dining, fitted kitchen with built in oven, hob and extractor fan, central island with storage, recessed lighting.Cloak cupboard for additional storage.\n\nLounge - \nA statement room with stunning full height window, a really impressive living space with solid fuel stove and laminate flooring.\n\nFirst Floor - \nLanding area with carpet, recessed lighting.\n\nShower Room - \nPartly tiled with wall mounted electric heater, extractor fan and Velux window.\n\nBedroom - \nA spacious double room with Velux window, carpet, eaves storage to remaining attic space.\n\nBedroom - \nAlso a double room with Velux window.\n\nManagement Company - \nGallagher Property Management475.81 is the service charge for the unit, of this 27.78 is the Sinking Fund contribution for the unit.\n\nIncluded in Sale - \nAll carpets, curtains, blinds and light fixtures and fittings\n\nLocation - \nSlane is internationally recognised for its rich history, stunning landscapes, and thriving tourism sector. The property is just minutes from the renowned Slane Castle, one of Ireland's most iconic landmarks, famous for its spectacular grounds and world-class concerts that attract visitors from across the globe.Located in the heart of the historic Boyne Valley, residents and guests are perfectly positioned to explore one of Ireland's most significant cultural and archaeological regions. Nearby attractions include the UNESCO World Heritage Site of Brú na Bóinne, encompassing the ancient passage tombs of Newgrange and Knowth, as well as a wealth of walking trails, heritage sites, golf courses, and scenic countryside.With excellent accessibility to Dublin via the N2 or M1 and Dublin Airport, combined with Slane's enduring popularity as a tourist destination, this property represents an outstanding opportunity for investors, holiday-home purchasers, or those seeking a unique residence in an exceptional village setting.\n\nMySherryFitz - \nFor transparency purposes, bidding shall be on our unique bidding platform \"MySherryFitz\", register today!\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>FPP for additional bedroom to ground floor (Planning File Ref: SA110380)</li><li>Full planning permission in place for Airbnb use</li><li>Attractive B Energy Rated two-bedroom dormer residence</li><li>Courtyard setting in the centre of Slane Village</li><li>Large windows providing excellent natural light throughout</li><li>One allocated parking space</li><li>Set adjacent to one of Slane's renowned Georgian houses</li><li>Excellent investment, holiday home, or permanent residence opportunity</li><li>Walking distance to village amenities and local attractions</li><li>Electric Heating with Solid Fuel Stove</li><li>Mains Services</ul>"
      },
